@startuml
title VNPay Sandbox - result verification and settlement
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
actor Customer
participant "Next.js" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "VNPay Sandbox" as VN
Customer -> UI: Choose payment
UI -> API: Start(orderId, JWT, key)
API -> DB: Short transaction: lock Order,
note right of DB: Validate owner, amount,
note right of DB: hold deadline and snapshots
API -> DB: Reuse/create attempt and key mapping; commit
API --> UI: Signed URL + expiry
Customer -> VN: Scan URL QR / open payment link
VN -> API: Signed IPN (may repeat or arrive late)
API -> API: Verify signature, merchant,
note right of API: reference, amount and result
API -> DB: Transaction: lock Order, recheck attempt
alt Valid order and no applied payment
 API -> DB: Payment + PAID + loyalty + audit
else Duplicate / inactive order
 API -> DB: REVIEW + handling case + audit
end
API -> DB: Commit
API --> VN: JSON acknowledgement
VN -> API: Browser Return (independent arrival order)
API --> UI: 303 to order page, no settlement here
UI -> API: Read authoritative status
opt Result unclear
 API -> VN: QueryDr outside DB transaction
 VN --> API: Signed query response
 API -> API: Validate; apply through same settlement logic
end
@enduml
